Subject: [PATCH] Belfry: Sign in with Open Source Village and the silent
 sign-in check

OAuth authorization code + PKCE against Keycast (VITE_KEYCAST_URL, client
VITE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, default belfry-chat); the token response's bunker URL
is connected like the bunker login screen does. Without a session the app
tries prompt=none once per tab; a failure opens the login screen, which
offers the button first.
